{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工程实践MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 幻觉如何防控？工业界有哪些实践方案？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工程实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工程实践\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Agent 幻觉如何防控？工业界有哪些实践方案？\" dir=\"auto\">Agent 幻觉如何防控？工业界有哪些实践方案？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LLM 容易产生幻觉（编造不存在的信息），Agent 系统如何从技术和产品层面防控幻觉？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、幻觉的两大来源</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>检索层幻觉</strong>：RAG 未召回到相关内容，LLM 靠自身知识编造</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>生成层幻觉</strong>：检索到了但 LLM 超发挥，在资料基础上加了自己的推断</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、三层防控体系</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>源头防控（降低幻觉产生概率）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Prompt 强约束</span>\nSYSTEM_PROMPT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n回答规则：\n1. 只能使用【参考资料】中的信息来回答，不得引入资料之外的知识\n2. 如果参考资料中没有足够信息，必须明确回答：「根据现有资料，无法回答该问题」\n3. 回答时标注信息来源（来自哪条参考资料）\n4. 不要推断、不要猜测、不要补充资料中没有明确说明的内容\n5. 不确定的内容直接说\"该信息我暂时无法确认\"\n\"\"\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 低温度参数</span>\nresponse <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 降低\"脑补欲\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. RAG + 高质量检索</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - 检索结果必须达到一定相似度阈值才使用</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - top-k 结果需要 rerank</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>过程控制（检索增强 + 推理约束）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HallucinationController</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"幻觉过程控制\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">rag_with_gate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Document<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检索质量门控：检索失败时直接拒答\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> docs <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>score <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"根据现有资料，无法回答该问题\"</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 只注入 top-3 最相关片段</span>\n        context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>d<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>page_content <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_generate_with_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">cot_verification</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"思维链 + 事实核查\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Step 1: 让模型列出判断该问题需要的关键信息</span>\n        required_info <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_extract_required_info<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Step 2: 逐一核对信息是否在资料中</span>\n        verification <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_verify_each_fact<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>required_info<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Step 3: 只使用已验证的信息生成回答</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_generate_from_verified_facts<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>verification<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>结果校验（生成后检测）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">PostHocVerifier</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成后事实核查\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">verify_with_citations</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> sources<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">tuple</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"引用核查：每条结论必须有来源\"\"\"</span>\n        claims <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_extract_claims<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> claim <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> claims<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_has_citation<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>claim<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> sources<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"未找到依据：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>claim<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> answer\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">secondary_llm_check</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"使用独立 LLM 评估答案忠实度\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        请评估以下回答是否完全基于提供的资料，是否存在编造信息。\n        资料：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        回答：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        \n        评分（0-1，1表示完全忠实）：\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n        score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> score  <span class=\"token comment\"># &lt; 0.8 触发人工审核</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、幻觉防控效果评估</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>幻觉降低率</th>\n<th>实现成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt 约束</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>所有场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG + 门控</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>知识问答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用溯源</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>专业领域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次校验</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高风险场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工审核</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>医疗/金融</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"RAG 检索做好了就不会有幻觉吗？\"</strong> — 错！RAG 解决的是\"不知道\"的问题，但 LLM 仍可能在检索结果上\"发挥\"</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"幻觉率降到多少算合格？\"</strong> — 通用场景 &lt; 5%，专业场景 &lt; 2%，高风险场景 &lt; 0.1%</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"在 Prompt 里加一句'请根据资料回答'就够了\" — 远远不够，需要系统级防控</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"Temperature=0 就不会有幻觉\" — 只能降低，不能消除</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}